# 默认把所有文件当二进制；下面的文本类型白名单必须写在它之后，
# 才能覆盖默认值（gitattributes 后写的规则覆盖先写的同名属性，
# binary 宏等价于 -text -diff -merge）。
* binary

# Windows batch scripts need CRLF; everything else normalises to LF.
*.bat  text diff eol=crlf
*.py   text diff eol=lf
*.c    text diff eol=lf
*.h    text diff eol=lf
*.md   text diff eol=lf
*.yml  text diff eol=lf
*.txt  text diff eol=lf
*.csv  text diff eol=lf
*.lock text diff eol=lf
sdkconfig.* text diff eol=lf
Kconfig*    text diff eol=lf

# ---- web assets（GitHub Pages 站点根目录 docs/）--------------------------
*.html text diff eol=lf
*.css  text diff eol=lf
*.js   text diff eol=lf
*.json text diff eol=lf
*.svg  text diff eol=lf
.gitattributes text diff eol=lf
.gitignore     text diff eol=lf

# vendored 第三方产物不参与文本 diff（three.js + 自托管字体）
docs/vendor/** binary
